{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人簡慕華曾於6月中在於社交平台突然上載自拍喊相，並附有文字：「I's not always easy，but that's life.（生活並不總是那麼容易，但這就是生活）」，情況令人擔心，及至翌日再於社交網上載打波相，並寫上「我回來了」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:54:04.938698+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:15:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:47:23.936969+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:47:23.936969+00:00","content_hash":"ba5f4de21b0bc9c1697c902f264015f8c321035d9a59c7fa161b9bb98b5ee67f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}